---

This directory (`device/`) is a modified copy of the `buddy/device/` and
`buddy/scripts/` directories of moremas/build-with-claude
(https://github.com/moremas/build-with-claude, commit b3b5888), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications by the Cardputer CLI Buddy project: the Hardware Buddy
protocol (`buddy_protocol.py`) was replaced with the encrypted protocol
described in `PROTOCOL.md`, `crypto.py`, `kana.py`, `voice.py`, `wifi_link.py`,
`buddy_app.py`, `scripts/deploy.py` and `tests/` were added, and
`buddy_ble.py`, `buddy_ui_cp.py`, `main.py` and `scripts/push.py` were
changed accordingly. `main.py` starts the app directly instead of showing a
launcher; the launcher (`launcher.py`, `burst_frames.py`,
`scripts/gen_burst_frames.py`), `buddy_state.py`, `buddy_chars.py` and the
apps under `apps/` were removed.
The pyserial copy under `onboard/scripts/vendor/` mentioned above (and in
LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY.md) is not included in this directory; `scripts/` uses
an installed pyserial instead.
